# Refund System API Testing
# Use with VS Code REST Client extension or Postman

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerToken = YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ===========================================
### CUSTOMER ENDPOINTS
### ===========================================

### 1. Create Refund (Bank Transfer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "refundAmount": 1000000,
  "isFullRefund": false,
  "refundMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "refundReason": "Sản phẩm bị lỗi màn hình",
  "customerBankName": "Vietcombank",
  "customerBankCode": "VCB",
  "customerAccountNumber": "1234567890123",
  "customerAccountHolder": "NGUYEN VAN A",
  "idempotencyKey": "refund-test-001"
}

### 2. Create Refund - Full Refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 2,
  "refundAmount": 2000000,
  "isFullRefund": true,
  "refundMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "refundReason": "Nhận sản phẩm không đúng với mô tả",
  "customerBankName": "Techcombank",
  "customerAccountNumber": "9876543210987",
  "customerAccountHolder": "TRAN THI B"
}

### 3. Get My Refunds (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 4. Get Refund by Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds/code/RF-20260620-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. Get Refund by Order ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds/order/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 6. Update Refund Info (Only PENDING_INFO status)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds/RF-20260620-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refundReason": "Sản phẩm bị lỗi màn hình, pin không giữ được",
  "customerBankName": "Vietcombank",
  "customerAccountNumber": "1234567890123",
  "customerAccountHolder": "NGUYEN VAN A"
}

### 7. Cancel Refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds/RF-20260620-000001/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ===========================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS
### ===========================================

### 8. Get All Refunds (No filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Get All Refunds (Filter by Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds?status=PENDING_APPROVAL&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Get All Refunds (Filter by Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds?customerId=100&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Get Refund by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Approve Refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13. Reject Refund (Requires reason)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Sản phẩm không có dấu hiệu lỗi, khách hàng sử dụng không đúng cách"
}

### 14. Process Refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1/process
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Complete Refund (With receipt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiptImageKey": "receipts/refund-1-receipt-20260620.jpg"
}

### 16. Mark Refund as Failed (Requires reason)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/3/fail
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Số tài khoản không hợp lệ, không thể chuyển khoản"
}

### 17. Put Refund on Hold (Requires reason)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/4/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cần xác minh thêm thông tin với khách hàng"
}

### 18. Soft Delete Refund
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/5?reason=Duplicate request
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===========================================
### TEST EDGE CASES
### ===========================================

### 19. Test Idempotency - Duplicate Request (Should return existing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "refundAmount": 1000000,
  "isFullRefund": false,
  "refundMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "refundReason": "Test idempotency",
  "customerBankName": "Vietcombank",
  "customerAccountNumber": "1234567890123",
  "customerAccountHolder": "NGUYEN VAN A",
  "idempotencyKey": "refund-test-001"
}

### 20. Test Invalid Bank Account (Should fail validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 3,
  "refundAmount": 1000000,
  "isFullRefund": false,
  "refundMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "refundReason": "Test",
  "customerAccountNumber": "123"
}

### 21. Test Refund Amount Exceeds Total (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "refundAmount": 999999999,
  "isFullRefund": false,
  "refundMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "refundReason": "Test",
  "customerBankName": "Vietcombank",
  "customerAccountNumber": "1234567890123",
  "customerAccountHolder": "TEST"
}

### 22. Test Cancel Already Approved Refund (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds/RF-20260620-000002/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 23. Test Customer Access Other's Refund (Should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds/code/RF-20260620-999999
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ===========================================
### WORKFLOW TEST SEQUENCE
### ===========================================

### Workflow Step 1: Create refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 10,
  "refundAmount": 1500000,
  "isFullRefund": true,
  "refundMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "refundReason": "Workflow test",
  "customerBankName": "Vietcombank",
  "customerAccountNumber": "1234567890123",
  "customerAccountHolder": "TEST USER"
}

### Workflow Step 2: Admin approve (use refund_id from step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Workflow Step 3: Admin process
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1/process
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Workflow Step 4: Admin complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/refunds/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiptImageKey": "receipts/test-receipt.jpg"
}

### ===========================================
### DATABASE VERIFICATION QUERIES
### ===========================================

# Run these in MySQL to verify:

# SELECT * FROM refunds ORDER BY refund_id DESC LIMIT 10;
# SELECT refund_id, refund_code, refund_sequence FROM refunds;
# SELECT * FROM refunds WHERE refund_status = 'PENDING_APPROVAL';
# SELECT * FROM refunds WHERE customer_id = 100;
# SELECT * FROM payment_logs WHERE refund_id IS NOT NULL;
